==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|lang=ang|aldormann}} or {{term|lang=ang|ealdormann}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|aldermen}}

# A member of several [[municipal]] [[legislative]] [[bodies]] in a [[city]] or [[town]].
# {{cx|1811|lang=en}}<!--{{context|obsolete|slang|lang=en}}--> A roasted turkey. {{only used in|alderman in chains|lang=en}} and '''{{l/en|alderman hung in chains}}'''.

